{"vap": [{"id": "vap", "headword": "वप्", "headword_slp1": "vap", "fold": "vap", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. वप् cl. 1. P. Ā. व॑पति, ˚ते (only pres. stem and ind.p. उप्त्वा, -उप्य), to shear, shave (Ā. ‘one's self’), cut off, AV.; TS.; Br.; GṛŚrS.;\nto crop (herbage), mow, cut (grass), graze, RV. vi, 6, 4 :\nCaus. वापयति, ˚ते (Pot. वापयीत, ĀśvŚr.), to cause (Ā. ‘one's self’) to be shorn, GṛŚrS.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "2. वप् cl. 1. P. Ā. (Dhātup. xxiii, 34) व॑पति, ˚ते (Pot. उपेत्, GṛS.; pf. उवाप, ऊपुः॑; ऊपे, RV. &c.; ववाप, MBh.; -वेपे, Kāś. on Pāṇ. vi, 4, 120; aor. अवाप्सीत्, Br. &c.;अवप्त Gr.; Pot. उप्यात्, ib.; fut. वप्ता, ib.; वप्स्य॑ति, Br.; वपिष्यति, MBh. &c.; inf. वप्तुम् Gr.; ind.p. उप्त्वा, MBh.; -उ॑प्य, RV. &c.),\nto strew, scatter (esp. seed), sow, bestrew, RV. &c. &c.;\nto throw, cast (dice), ib.;\nto procreate, beget (see वपुस् and 2. वप्तृ);\nto throw or heap up, dam up, AV. :\nPass. उप्य॑ते (aor. वापि, Br.), to be strewn or sown, RV. &c. &c.:\nCaus. वापयति (aor. अवीवपत् Gr.) to sow, plant, put in the ground, MBh. :\nDesid. विवप्सति, ˚ते Gr.:\nIntens. वावप्यते, वावप्ति, ib.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "vapa": [{"id": "vapa", "headword": "वप", "headword_slp1": "vapa", "fold": "vapa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. वप m. shaving, shearing, W.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "2. वप॑ m. one who sows, a sower, VS. (cf. g. पचादि)", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["वपः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["vapaH"]}, {"id": "vapA", "headword": "वपा", "headword_slp1": "vapA", "fold": "vapa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "वपा (आ), f. See below.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "वपा॑ f. a mound or heap thrown up by ants (see वामिक-व्˚)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a cavity, hollow, hole, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "the skin or membrane investing the intestines or parts of the viscera, the caul